---

This repository also contains prompts, deliberation logs, and a fixed question
set derived from three third-party datasets, each under its own license:
MMLU (cais/mmlu), MoralChoice (ninoscherrer/moralchoice), and Moral Machine
(Jerry999/MoralMachineHuman). See each dataset's own page for its license
terms; this MIT license covers only the code in this repository.

The eleven open-weight models used to generate the deliberation logs are each
under their own respective license (Apache 2.0, Meta Llama Community License,
Gemma Terms of Use, etc. — see the root README for the per-model list). This
license does not cover those models' weights.
